## Chapter 43

Let her hymns of praise be said thus quietly :

NIGHT HYMN OF PRAISE OF WIDOWS

Holy, holy, without spot, who hast Thy dwelling in the
light, God of Abraham, and of Isaac, and of Jacob, God of
Enoch and David, of Elijah, of Elisha, of Moses, of Joshua,
and of the prophets and of the others who in truth preached
Thy Name, God of the Apostles, the God who hast guided all
